WEBVTT

00:00:00.722 --> 00:00:01.615
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 1

00:00:06.717 --> 00:00:08.374
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> Hi, Sarah!

00:00:08.845 --> 00:00:09.941
Come in.

00:00:10.487 --> 00:00:11.330
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:12.882 --> 00:00:15.367
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> This is my husband, Mark.

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:16.027
<v><b>Mark:</b></v> Hello.

00:00:16.146 --> 00:00:16.959
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Hi.

00:00:17.877 --> 00:00:20.667
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> And these are our children.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:21.875
<v><b>Children:</b></v> Hello!

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:23.956
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> What are their names?

00:00:24.383 --> 00:00:28.170
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> Her name’s Emma, and his name’s Oliver.

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:31.280
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> And this is our cat.

00:00:31.563 --> 00:00:34.378
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Ah! What’s its name?

00:00:34.547 --> 00:00:38.565
<v><b>Emma:</b></v> Her name is Princess. She’s a girl.

00:00:38.822 --> 00:00:40.365
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Oh, sorry.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:45.936
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 2

00:00:47.106 --> 00:00:51.022
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> The name of the restaurant is Mario’s Bistro.

00:00:51.355 --> 00:00:54.393
The phone number’s on the table over there.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.260
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Great, thanks.

00:00:56.558 --> 00:00:59.847
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> And my husband’s phone number is there, too.

00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:00.988
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> OK.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.262
And your number is in my phone.

00:01:05.308 --> 00:01:09.713
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> Now, children. Sarah is your babysitter.

00:01:10.209 --> 00:01:11.089
Be good.

00:01:13.726 --> 00:01:14.812
<v><b>Children:</b></v> OK, Mum.